      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>Hoshana Rabbah is a time for prayer, where we call out to God one final time, a last vestige of the Yamim Noraim, asking for Divine salvation. We recite a litany of Hoshana prayers, asking God to “Save Us” in the new year.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>This year we need salvation more than ever, with all the challenges the world is facing. I hope people find this new Hoshana text helpful in formulating our requests this year.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_33879_introduction"/>
