      </j:conditional>
      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>Rabbi Dr. Shlomo Zuckier’s “Hoshana Prayer for Hoshana Rabbah 2020” was first published on his Facebook page.</tei:p>
